servers authorized by that key, for as long as that key remains valid.

A license key may cover a single plugin or a bundle of plugins. The scope of
what a given key authorizes is determined by the license records held by the
copyright holder.

No other right is granted. Except as provided in section 1A, use of the
Software without a valid license key is unlicensed use.

1A. FREE USE WITH RSDEVELOPMENT PLUGINS

The Software is the shared library that plugins published by RsDevelopment need
in order to run. As an exception to section 1, anyone may install and run the
Software free of charge, without a license key, on any Minecraft server, for the
sole purpose of running plugins published by RsDevelopment, whether those
plugins are free or paid.

This exception covers only installing and running the Software unmodified, as
distributed by the copyright holder. Every restriction in section 2 still
applies, and each paid RsDevelopment plugin still requires its own valid
license key under that plugin's license.

