This license terminates automatically, without notice, if the key expires, is
cancelled or is revoked, or if the licensee breaches any term of this license.
On termination the licensee must stop using the Software and delete every copy
in their possession.

Sharing a license key with anyone outside the licensee's own authorized servers
is a breach of this license and grounds for revocation without refund.

